{"ref":"BDB, שְׁפִי","hw":"שְׁפִי","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפִי</span></big>  <strong>n.m. bareness, smooth or bare</strong> (treeless) <strong>height</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>bareness</em>, <a data-ref=\"Job 33:21\" href=\"/Job.33.21\">Jb 33:21</a> Kt (v. √).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>bare place, height:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֑פִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:3\" href=\"/Numbers.23.3\">Nu 23:3</a> (E), i.e. an outlook-point; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפָיִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.9\">49:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.21\">Je 3:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפָיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.2\">3:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.11\">4:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְבָּר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.29\">7:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.12\">12:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בַּמִּדְבָּר)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.6\">14:6</a>.","next":"BDB, אַשְׁפָּה","prev":"BDB, שְׁפוֹ"}